abstract: "Multi-physics simulation and engineering validation for sub-10nm Gate-All-Around (GAA) CNTFETs using a Gradient Bandgap Nanomultilayer (GBN) dielectric to eliminate EMP thermal shock and filamental breakdown under sub-nanosecond 18 MV/cm transients."
